{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g-auto","type":"group","label":"🤖 Automate 采集（手机）","x":-18,"y":-64,"width":396,"height":567,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a-flow","color":"4","text":"Flow「Phone Usage Logger」（整体）\n• 三支路: 前台包名 / 亮灭屏 / 心跳+上传\n• 权限: 无障碍观察 + 文件管理 + 忽略电池限制\n• 常驻运行 + 开机启动（Fork 出三条 fiber）","x":0,"y":0,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"a-files","color":"3","text":"Documents/PhoneUsage/\n• YYYY-MM-DD-{foreground,screen,heartbeat}.jsonl\n• 心跳每 ~15 分钟一条；启动即写一条\n• ⚠️ 旧版无日期文件是否已清理（待确认）","x":0,"y":122,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"a-upload","color":"4","text":"上传循环（每 15 分钟）\n• PUT /upload/{3 个文件} + X-Upload-Token\n• 30s 超时; Failure catch(Retry 1) 记日志后\n  进 Delay(900s Inexact + Wake up)\n• 401/400 需人工查 HTTP 状态码与 Pi 日志","x":0,"y":244,"width":360,"height":111,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"a-cleanup","color":"2","text":"自动清理 flow（每天 ~03:10）\n• 删除 15 天前 *.jsonl（File delete 通配符）\n• ⚠️ 待确认: 文档标注「尚未实施」\n• 异机 .flo 备份同样未建立（Restic 未启用）","x":0,"y":381,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"g-bridge","type":"group","label":"🔗 Focus Bridge 1.3.3（手机）","x":366,"y":-64,"width":396,"height":903,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b-service","color":"4","text":"BridgeForegroundService（后台生命线）\n• 15s pending 轮询；5min 心跳（失败 1min 重试）\n• START_STICKY + 常驻通知 + 开机/升级恢复\n• 不把存活交给 Automate 或「不做手机控」","x":384,"y":0,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"b-statemachine","color":"4","text":"Offer 状态机 + 执行策略（纯 Java 可测）\n• 锁屏等待 ≤120s；解锁后给完整 10s\n• 执行: 20s 窗口 × 最多 3 次（按 request 计）\n• 时长: <8m→30m，8–15m→20m，≥15m→过期","x":384,"y":122,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"b-ui","color":"4","text":"InterventionPromptActivity（选择页）\n• 接受 / 拒绝 / 10s 超时 ignored\n• 不对其他应用导出；禁止外部/返回键绕过","x":384,"y":244,"width":360,"height":81,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"b-a11y","color":"4","text":"FocusBridgeAccessibilityService\n• 后台打开选择页、启动「不做手机控」\n• 查找目标窗口 + 已校准可见点击","x":384,"y":351,"width":360,"height":81,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"b-notify","color":"4","text":"GetawayNotificationListenerService\n• 读取授权通知，确认快速番茄真实计时\n• 保存最近 20min 候选（含 AUTO_CANCEL）\n• 过滤「今天准备怎么过」推广提示","x":384,"y":458,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"b-store","color":"3","text":"本地持久化（SharedPreferences）\n• 活动请求/attempts/result_pending/墓碑\n• 24h 完成墓碑 ≤64 条 → 请求级幂等\n• 决定提交成功前，轮询快照不得覆盖","x":384,"y":580,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"b-pair","color":"2","text":"配对链路（换机/重装时）\n• pair-focus-bridge.ps1: ADB run-as 读私有 token\n  → SSH 直写 Pi（不打印 token）\n• ⚠️ 正式签名 APK 的应用内配对尚未实现\n• 新屏幕需重新校准坐标/网格偏移","x":384,"y":702,"width":360,"height":111,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"g-exec","type":"group","label":"⏱️ 执行端","x":750,"y":-64,"width":396,"height":171,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b-getaway","color":"4","text":"「不做手机控」APP\n• 快速番茄（5min）/专注的实际执行\n• 通过 getaway_pomo 通知回传事件","x":768,"y":0,"width":360,"height":81,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"g-net2","type":"group","label":"🌐 网络路径与通知","x":1134,"y":-64,"width":396,"height":460,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n-main","color":"5","text":"公网 HTTPS 主链路（⚠️ 代理机制待确认）\n• https://pi.taild4d3f7.ts.net（文档称 :443）\n• 固定白名单 /focus-bridge/* + /upload/*\n• 每设备独立 Bearer；规避 Clash 与\n  Tailscale 单 VPN 冲突","x":1152,"y":0,"width":360,"height":126,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"n-backup","color":"5","text":"Tailnet 备用 :8460\n• 仅公网 IOException 后使用\n• 依赖手机 Tailscale 在线（⚠️ 安装状态\n  旧文档与迁移流程表述冲突）","x":1152,"y":152,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"g-pi2","type":"group","label":"🖥️ Pi 交互侧","x":1518,"y":-64,"width":396,"height":735,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"p-recv","color":"4","text":"phone-usage-receiver :8765\n• token 校验 / 大小≤20MiB / UTF-8 / 逐行 JSON\n• 合并去重排序 + 原子写入\n• incoming/ 镜像 + archive/YYYY-MM-DD 权威\n• 维护 timer 03:30（30/365 天）","x":1536,"y":0,"width":360,"height":111,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"p-halfhour","color":"4","text":"半小时处理链（phone/tablet_facts 输入）\n• 手机/平板 JSONL → facts → 合并 → 标签\n• → 语义时间线 → 指标 → AI 报告\n• 详见 03-Pi内部流程.canvas","x":1536,"y":137,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"p-garden","color":"4","text":"focus-garden 介入调度 :8838\n• offer/decision/execute/event 固定白名单\n• 请求保留 16min；重复 final 幂等\n  （already_completed，不生成第二份）\n• 系统状态面板有「重复请求防护」计数","x":1536,"y":259,"width":360,"height":111,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"p-token","color":"3","text":"Pi 私有凭据（600 权限，不落文档）\n• /home/conrad/phone_usage/token.txt\n  （Automate 上传，X-Upload-Token）\n• /home/conrad/phone_usage/focus_bridge_token.txt\n  （桥接 Bearer）","x":1536,"y":396,"width":360,"height":111,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"p-notify","color":"5","text":"Pi ntfy sender / timers\n• 半小时、日报、15:00、深夜、系统维护\n• 发送回执留在 Pi data 目录\n• 主题来自私有 env，不写入客户端","x":1536,"y":518,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"m-ntfy","color":"5","text":"ntfy APP（手机，人工查看）\n• 订阅私有主题，展示日报/15:00/深夜/维护/半小时提醒\n• 不产生提醒；故障先查 Pi 回执与订阅状态","x":1152,"y":274,"width":360,"height":96,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"g-fail","type":"group","label":"🧯 故障排查入口","x":1902,"y":-64,"width":396,"height":261,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f-failures","color":"1","text":"常见故障入口\n• 桥接: 手机私有目录 files/focus-bridge.log\n  + 界面「刷新运行日志」\n• 状态机验证: verify.ps1（13+8+5 项 + 离线构建）\n• Automate: 10.3 快速自检 / 心跳缺失 >30min\n• Pi 侧: journalctl -u phone-usage-receiver\n  / focus-garden.service；ss -lntp :8765\n• 卡 pending/重复执行: 查 24h 墓碑与\n  Pi 请求级幂等计数","x":1920,"y":0,"width":360,"height":171,"type":"text"},
		{"id":"g-doc2","type":"group","label":"📚 对应文档","x":2286,"y":-64,"width":396,"height":464,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d-bridge","type":"file","color":"6","file":"非笔记内容/工作流程与系统运维/我的专注花园/专注花园桥接手机APP.md","x":2304,"y":0,"width":360,"height":74},
		{"id":"d-phone","type":"file","color":"6","file":"非笔记内容/工作流程与系统运维/手机使用记录系统——手机端操作与维护指南.md","x":2304,"y":100,"width":360,"height":74},
		{"id":"d-migrate","type":"file","color":"6","file":"非笔记内容/工作流程与系统运维/Pi系统手机端与电脑端迁移配置流程.md","x":2304,"y":200,"width":360,"height":74},
		{"id":"d-ntfy","type":"file","color":"6","file":"非笔记内容/工作流程与系统运维/ntfy提醒系统配置.md","x":2304,"y":300,"width":360,"height":74},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 手机端内部流程\nAutomate 采集 / Focus Bridge 介入 / ntfy 展示 / 与 Pi 的交互。","x":0,"y":-210,"width":620,"height":66,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"🎨 图例\n🟢 绿=自动流程/服务  🟡 黄=数据/配置/状态\n🔵 青=网络边界/接口  🟣 紫=文档（点击打开）\n🔴 红=人工操作/故障入口  🟠 橙=⚠️待确认\n→ 边=数据流/触发关系\n维护：改模块前先看它的入边（依赖）与出边（影响范围）","x":660,"y":-340,"width":430,"height":126,"color":"6"}
	],
